Allow naive evaluation to check seminaive matching

Expose the evaluation strategy through compiler options, a Cargo
build-script helper, and the CLI while keeping seminaive evaluation
as the default. Naive evaluation matches all facts in user and
functionality rules.

Include the strategy in cache keys so switching modes cannot
reuse stale code. Run the existing evaluation suite in either
mode to compare behavior across equality, definedness, and
morphism propagation.
